    - dogfood
    - gif-search
    - github
    - himalaya
    - inspecting-hermes-desktop-dom
    - legacy-openclaw-workflows
    - llm-wiki
    - manim-video
    - node-inspect-debugger
    - notion
    - obsidian
    - opencode
    - p5js
    - popular-web-designs
